    LLM: 'Game: 28 dominoes. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '28 dominoes is block or draw dominoes with a double-6 set of 28 tiles. Two to five players; 7 tiles each (2-3 players) or 5 (4-5 players). Highest double leads. Match numbers on open ends; doubles placed crosswise. Block: pass if cannot play. Draw: draw from boneyard until you can play. First out wins; or lowest pips if blocked.',
